WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:02.000
Hi there.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.880
I'm Robbie Devine from the
physical security team.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.000
We're excited you're joining
us as a volunteer at MongoDB.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.200
Local and helping represent
MongoDB on the conference floor.

00:00:12.415 --> 00:00:17.055
As a volunteer, you're going to be
supporting our customers and prospects,

00:00:17.055 --> 00:00:19.535
and you'll also be a part of
the team that keeps our brand

00:00:19.535 --> 00:00:21.975
and our information safe.

00:00:22.335 --> 00:00:25.370
Because .Locals are
large, high energy events,

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:29.290
they can also attract unwanted
attention from threat actors.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:30.970
That might sound a bit dramatic,

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.090
but the reality is when
you bring a lot of people,

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.890
technology, and
information together,

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.525
the likelihood of
security incidents rises,

00:00:39.525 --> 00:00:43.645
and your vigilance plays a
key role in preventing that.

00:00:43.845 --> 00:00:46.525
That's where this
short course comes in.

00:00:46.805 --> 00:00:50.805
Our Physical Security team has
put this module together to

00:00:50.805 --> 00:00:51.925
give you practical,

00:00:51.925 --> 00:00:56.300
easy to remember guidance on
how to stay secure at dot local.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.820
From the moment you set off on
your trip to your time on the

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:04.100
conference floor and after
your volunteer shift ends.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.980
You'll learn what
to look out for,

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.145
how to handle situations
that don't feel quite right,

00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:12.185
and how you can play your part
in keeping the event safe and

00:01:12.185 --> 00:01:14.225
secure for everyone.

00:01:14.345 --> 00:01:15.625
By the end of this course,

00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.745
you'll know exactly how you
can contribute to a secure,

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:23.539
successful event experience for
our customers and ourselves alike.

00:01:23.539 --> 00:01:25.019
Let's get started.